title: Upgrade Your Dependency Management with pip-tools
---
pub_date: 2024-03-13
---
author: Olena Yefymenko
---
twitter_handle: olena_yefymenko
---
body:

Dependency management is one of the most important issues for every Software Engineer.
The tool we choose for dependency management is fundamental and has a significant impact
on many aspects of our applications. I want to talk about dependency management in Python,
which plays a key role in the reproducibility of environments, sharing code, and deployment
of our applications.